│ control during IUC insertion include non‐steroidal anti‐inflammatory drugs (NSAIDs), local cervical anesthetics, and │
│ cervical ripening agents such as misoprostol.                                                                        │
│                                                                                                                      │
│ Review objective:                                                                                                    │
│ To review randomized controlled trials (RCTs) of interventions for reducing IUC insertion‐related pain               │
│                                                                                                                      │
